# Git push (Dose)

Push **only** when the user asks.

## Required in this session (exit 0)

```sh
npm test -- --watchAll=false
npm run lint
npm run build
```

Then: not behind `main`; attribution flags false; never `--no-verify`.

```sh
git push -u origin HEAD   # first push
git push                  # later
```

Report the branch. Do not open a PR unless also asked.
